title: Raritan PX-2000 Family: PDU Overcurrent Protector
agents: snmp
catalog: hw/environment/raritan
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check monitors the electrical current of overcurrent protectors
 of the Raritan PX-2000 family of intelligent rack power distribution
 units (iPDUs). As well as the current, the status as reported by the
 device is taken into account, whereby the status open is interpreted
 as CRIT, closed as OK, and unavailable as UNKNOWN.

 Current sensor availability and state are evaluated separately. An absent
 or unavailable current sensor reports UNKNOWN and produces no current metric.
 Device current alarms are retained alongside rule thresholds. Missing or
 unknown protector states report UNKNOWN instead of causing a check exception.

item:
 The overcurrent protector ID, e.g. C1. When multiple PDUs are found,
 the PDU ID is prefixed, e.g. 1/C1.

discovery:
 One service is created for each overcurrent protector.
